# Patterns to ignore when building packages.
.DS_Store
.git/
.gitignore
*.orig
.vscode/

# Anchored to the chart root on purpose — NOT a bare `*.tgz`, which is what
# `helm create` scaffolds and what broke this chart's first real publish.
# `helm dependency build` fetches the `common` dependency as
# `charts/common-<ver>.tgz`, and a bare `*.tgz` hides it from the loader, so
# `helm package` then fails with:
#
#   Error: found in Chart.yaml, but missing in charts/ directory: common
#
# It reproduces only when `charts/` holds the tarball *alone*. A working
# tree that also has an unpacked `charts/common/` from an earlier
# `helm dependency update` packages fine, which is exactly why this passed
# locally and failed in CI.
/*.tgz
